sequenceDiagram
    participant PM as Project Manager
    participant UI as E4H Web UI (Extended)
    participant GW as E4H API Gateway (Existing)
    participant AUTH as E4H Auth Service (Existing)
    participant FPS as Field Planner Service (NEW)
    participant PS as Project Service (Existing)
    participant HFR as Health Facility Registry (Existing)
    participant HRMS as eGov HRMS (Existing)
    participant FS as eGov Filestore (Existing)
    participant MDMS as eGov MDMS v2 (Existing)
    participant WF as eGov Workflow v2 (Existing)
    participant DB as E4H PostgreSQL (Shared)
    participant CACHE as Redis Cache (Shared)
    
    Note over PM,CACHE: E4H Platform Integrated Project & Field Plan Creation
    
    PM->>UI: Navigate to Create Project (E4H Platform)
    UI->>GW: GET /user/oauth/me (existing auth)
    GW->>AUTH: Validate E4H JWT token
    AUTH-->>GW: Return user details with roles
    GW-->>UI: Return authenticated E4H user
    UI-->>PM: Display create project form
    
    PM->>UI: Fill project metadata
    Note over PM,UI: Name, Type, Dates, Geography, Justification Code
    
    PM->>UI: Click "Create Project"
    UI->>GW: POST /project/v1/_create (existing API)
    GW->>PS: Forward to existing Project Service
    
    PS->>HRMS: GET /egov-hrms/employees/_search
    Note over PS,HRMS: Validate PM exists and has project creation role
    HRMS-->>PS: Employee validated with permissions
    
    alt Employee Validation Failed
        HRMS-->>PS: Employee not found or insufficient permissions
        PS-->>GW: Return authorization error
        GW-->>UI: Return 403 Unauthorized
        UI-->>PM: Show "Insufficient permissions" error
    else Employee Validated
        PS->>MDMS: POST /egov-mdms-service/v1/_search
        Note over PS,MDMS: Validate project type, geography against master data
        MDMS-->>PS: Master data validation passed
        
        PS->>DB: Check project name uniqueness
        DB-->>PS: Name is unique
        
        PS->>DB: Save to existing project tables
        DB-->>PS: Project created with UUID
        
        PS->>WF: POST /egov-wf-v2/process/_transition
        Note over PS,WF: Initialize project approval workflow
        WF-->>PS: Workflow initiated (status=INITIATED)
        
        PS-->>GW: ProjectResponse with ID
        GW-->>UI: Project created successfully
        UI-->>PM: Display project ID and success message
    end
    
    Note over PM,CACHE: Field Plan Creation (New Extension)
    
    PM->>UI: Navigate to "Create Field Plan"
    UI->>GW: GET /project/v1/_search
    Note over UI,GW: Load existing projects for selection
    GW->>PS: Get projects for this tenant
    PS->>DB: Query existing project table
    DB-->>PS: Return project list
    PS-->>GW: ProjectSearchResponse
    GW-->>UI: Available projects
    UI-->>PM: Show project selection dropdown
    
    PM->>UI: Select project and fill field plan details
    Note over PM,UI: Plan Name, Start/End Dates, Geography Scope, Activities
    
    PM->>UI: Click "Create Field Plan"
    UI->>GW: POST /field-planner/v1/field-plans/_create
    GW->>FPS: Forward to new Field Planner Service
    
    FPS->>PS: GET /project/v1/_search
    Note over FPS,PS: Validate selected project exists
    PS-->>FPS: Project exists and is active
    
    FPS->>HRMS: GET /egov-hrms/employees/_search
    Note over FPS,HRMS: Validate field plan creator
    HRMS-->>FPS: Creator validated
    
    FPS->>DB: Save to new field_plans table
    DB-->>FPS: Field plan created with ID
    
    FPS-->>GW: FieldPlanResponse
    GW-->>UI: Field plan created
    UI-->>PM: Show "Field plan created, assign facilities"
    
    Note over PM,CACHE: Facility Assignment (E4H Integration)
    
    PM->>UI: Click "Assign Facilities"
    UI->>GW: GET /field-planner/v1/field-plans/{id}/facilities/template
    GW->>FPS: Generate facility template
    
    FPS->>MDMS: POST /egov-mdms-service/v1/_search
    Note over FPS,MDMS: Get boundary data for template dropdowns
    MDMS-->>FPS: Boundary hierarchy master data
    
    FPS->>FS: POST /filestore/v1/files (generate template)
    FS-->>FPS: Template file stored with UUID
    FPS-->>GW: Template download URL
    GW-->>UI: Template file reference
    UI-->>PM: Excel template downloaded
    
    PM->>PM: Fill facility selection in Excel
    PM->>UI: Upload completed facility selection
    
    UI->>GW: POST /field-planner/v1/field-plans/{id}/facilities/upload
    GW->>FPS: Process facility upload
    
    FPS->>FS: POST /filestore/v1/files (store upload)
    FS-->>FPS: File stored and parsed
    
    FPS->>HFR: GET /facility/v1/_search (validate facilities)
    Note over FPS,HFR: Validate each facility ID exists and is active
    
    alt Invalid Facilities Found
        HFR-->>FPS: Some facilities not found or inactive
        FPS->>FS: POST /filestore/v1/files (generate error report)
        FS-->>FPS: Error report stored
        FPS-->>GW: Return validation errors
        GW-->>UI: Show validation errors
        UI-->>PM: "Some facilities invalid, download error report"
        
        PM->>UI: Download error report
        UI->>GW: GET /filestore/v1/files/{errorReportId}
        GW->>FS: Retrieve error report
        FS-->>GW: Error report file
        GW-->>UI: Download error report
        UI-->>PM: Fix errors and re-upload
        
    else All Facilities Valid
        HFR-->>FPS: All facilities validated and active
        
        loop For each valid facility
            FPS->>DB: Save to field_plan_facilities table (new)
            DB-->>FPS: Facility assignment created
        end
        
        FPS->>CACHE: Cache field plan facility assignments
        CACHE-->>FPS: Data cached
        
        FPS-->>GW: Assignment successful
        GW-->>UI: Facilities assigned successfully
        UI-->>PM: Show facility assignment summary
        
        Note over PM,CACHE: Create Activity Assignments
        
        PM->>UI: Click "Assign Activities to SPOCs"
        UI->>GW: GET /field-planner/v1/activities/_search
        GW->>FPS: Get available activities
        FPS->>MDMS: POST /egov-mdms-service/v1/_search
        Note over FPS,MDMS: Get activity master data
        MDMS-->>FPS: Activity types with conditions
        FPS-->>GW: Available activities
        GW-->>UI: Show activity selection
        UI-->>PM: Select activities and assign SPOCs
        
        PM->>UI: Assign activities to HRMS employees
        UI->>GW: POST /field-planner/v1/activity-assignments/_create
        GW->>FPS: Process activity assignments
        
        FPS->>HRMS: GET /egov-hrms/employees/_search
        Note over FPS,HRMS: Validate assigned SPOCs exist and active
        HRMS-->>FPS: SPOCs validated
        
        FPS->>DB: Save to activity_assignments table (new)
        DB-->>FPS: Assignments created
        
        FPS-->>GW: Activity assignments successful
        GW-->>UI: SPOCs assigned to activities
        UI-->>PM: Field plan setup completed
    
    end
    
    Note over PM,CACHE: E4H Platform Integration Complete
    Note over PM,CACHE: Project created via existing Project Service
    Note over PM,CACHE: Field Plan created via new Field Planner Service
    Note over PM,CACHE: Facilities validated via Health Facility Registry
    Note over PM,CACHE: SPOCs validated via eGov HRMS
    Note over PM,CACHE: All data stored in shared E4H PostgreSQL database 